        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hume auctioneers- We Get The Pick Of The Crop\n\nThe finest penthouse apartment to come to market in Stradbrook for many years, this spectacular 2-bedroom Penthouse enjoys the best setting in Parkside. \n\nSet on a super quiet corridor, this stunning home enjoys a south facing aspect with beautiful views over The Downs and surrounding parkland. \n\nStep inside and discover a bright, spacious and beautifully proportioned penthouse apartment designed for modern, low-maintenance living. Flooded with natural light from extensive glazing and full-height doors, the impressive open-plan living, dining and kitchen area creates an inviting space for relaxing or entertaining. The contemporary fitted kitchen offers an excellent range of storage and workspace, complete with integrated appliances and a generous breakfast bar, while the living area opens directly onto an exceptional private balcony stretching the length of the apartment, providing a wonderful outdoor extension with pleasant leafy views.\nThe accommodation comprises two generously sized double bedrooms, both filled with natural light and offering excellent wardrobe space, and direct access to the balcony. The principal bedroom enjoys the added luxury of a fully tiled ensuite shower room. The second double bedroom is equally spacious and is serviced by a large family bathroom featuring both a bath and overhead shower.\nA welcoming entrance hall with timber flooring provides excellent storage and completes the accommodation. Finished in a bright, neutral palette throughout, the apartment offers a superb blank canvas ready for immediate occupation.\nWith its impressive proportions, extensive outdoor space and superb penthouse setting, this is a stylish home that will appeal equally to owner-occupiers, professionals and investors seeking a quality property in an excellent location.\n\n Stradbrook is considered the finest apartment development in town, and we consider this the one of the finest apartments in Stradbrook. \n\nWith designated parking, a full-time caretaker and elegant elevators, Stradbrook is 5 star living in town. Shops, schools, sports and transport are on your doorstep. Gas central heating and high-speed broadband installed. Book your viewing now.\n"
      },
